 mechanics"},{"text":"Slope stability"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Tunnels"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Rock-mass classification"},{"text":"Structural geology"},{"text":"Groundwater"},{"text":"Excavation support"}]}]},{"heading":"Study Abroad","kind":"abroad","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Relevant postgraduate areas:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Geotechnical Engineering"},{"text":"Engineering Geology"},{"text":"Geological Engineering"},{"text":"Earth Science"},{"text":"Geophysics"},{"text":"Geoenvironmental Engineering"},{"text":"Mining Geotechnics"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Potential destinations"},{"type":"table","header":["Country","Relevant Strength"],"rows":[[{"text":"Canada"},{"text":"Geotechnical engineering, mining and infrastructure"}],[{"text":"Australia"},{"text":"Mining geotechnics, geology and infrastructure"}],[{"text":"UK"},{"text":"Engineering geology and geotechnical engineering"}],[{"text":"Germany"},{"text":"Geotechnical and geological engineering"}],[{"text":"Netherlands"},{"text":"Geotechnical and water-related engineering"}],[{"text":"USA"},{"text":"Geotechnical engineering and earth sciences"}],[{"text":"Norway"},{"text":"Rock engineering and infrastructure"}]]},{"type":"p","text":"For a B.Sc. graduate, carefully check whether the programme accepts science graduates or requires an engineering degree."}]},{"heading":"Career Progression","kind":"growth","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"0–2 Years"},{"type":"h","text":"Geological/Geotechnical Trainee"},{"type":"p","text":"Build:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Field investigation"},{"text":"Soil/rock identification"},{"text":"Borehole logging"},{"text":"Laboratory testing"},{"text":"GIS"}]},{"type":"h","text":"2–5 Years"},{"type":"h","text":"Geotechnical Analyst / Engineering Geology Specialist"},{"type":"p","text":"Take ownership of:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Investigation data"},{"text":"Site reports"},{"text":"Geological interpretation"},{"text":"Laboratory results"},{"text":"GIS a